
# SCOTUS composition - the independent check that isn't up for direct
# election (was: no direct Weimar equivalent; closest analogue is how
# Hindenburg's own disposition mattered independent of Reichstag math).
# -10 = solid liberal majority, +10 = solid conservative majority.

(..-7) solid liberal majority
(-7..-3) liberal-leaning majority
(-3..-0.5) narrow liberal majority
(-0.5..0.5) evenly divided
(0.5..3) narrow conservative majority
(3..7) conservative-leaning majority
(7..) solid conservative majority
